@startuml
title Resumefolio | Google operation outcomes
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #64748B
skinparam activity {
 BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
 BorderColor #64748B
 FontColor #17324D
 DiamondBackgroundColor #FEF3C7
 DiamondBorderColor #B45309
 StartColor #17324D
 EndColor #17324D
}
start
:Identify intended operation, user and selected account / calendar;
if (Product authority and provider grant valid?) then (yes)
 :Check operation-specific inputs and user intent;
 if (Defined conditions satisfied?) then (yes)
  :Perform bounded authorized provider work;
  if (Result supported by provider evidence?) then (yes)
   :Record actual accepted / rejected / partial result;
  else (unknown)
   :Preserve uncertainty and reconcile under agreed policy; <<#FEF3C7>>
  endif
  :Apply only effects established by the reconciled outcome;
 else (no)
  :Report invalid or incomplete request; <<#FEF3C7>>
 endif
else (no)
 :Do not perform protected provider operation;
 :Show permitted access / reconnect guidance; <<#FEF3C7>>
endif
:Show truthful bounded outcome without secrets;
stop
legend bottom
Send acceptance is not recipient delivery or read confirmation.
Uncertain outbound sends need reconciliation before retry.
No actual account connection or provider operation is performed here.
endlegend
@enduml
